  "raw_meta_yaml": "context:\n  version: \"1.4.10\"\n\npackage:\n  name: ini-file\n  version: ${{ version }}\n\nsource:\n  url: https://github.com/bitnami/ini-file/archive/refs/tags/v${{ version }}.tar.gz\n  sha256: eb4cc92095f27f0d6cb1a091a53b539deab5d2998ba4a736756fb2cabd7213cb\n\nbuild:\n  number: 0\n  script:\n    interpreter: nu\n    content:\n      - let prefix = $env.LIBRARY_PREFIX? | default $env.PREFIX\n      # build main app and generate license data\n      - let build_time = date now | format date \"%Y-%m-%dT%H:%M:%SZ\"\n      - let short_commit_hash = (http get https://api.github.com/repos/bitnami/ini-file/commits/v${{ version }}).sha | str substring 0..6\n      - go build\n        -o ($prefix)/bin/\n        -v\n        -ldflags=$'-s -w -X main.buildDate=($build_time) -X main.commit=($short_commit_hash) -X main.version=${{ version }}'\n        -trimpath\n        .\n      - go-licenses save . --save_path=library_licenses\n\nrequirements:\n  build:\n    - ${{ compiler('go-nocgo') }}\n    - go-licenses\n    - nushell\n\ntests:\n  - script:\n      - if: win\n        then: ini-file --help 2>&1 | findstr /c:\"Usage:\" >nul\n      - if: unix\n        then: ini-file --help 2>&1 | grep -q \"Usage:\"\n  - package_contents:\n      bin:\n        - ini-file\n      strict: true\n\nabout:\n  summary: A CLI tool for manipulating INI files\n  description: |\n    ini-file is a command-line tool that allows manipulating INI files.\n    It supports setting, getting, and deleting values in INI files.\n  license: Apache-2.0\n  license_file:\n    - LICENSE.md\n    - library_licenses/\n  homepage: https://github.com/bitnami/ini-file\n  repository: https://github.com/bitnami/ini-file\n\nextra:\n  recipe-maintainers:\n    - salim-b\n",
